# Copy to .env.local and fill in values.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Pholio app origin — every CTA on this site links here.
# Must also be set in the Netlify UI (netlify.toml sets it for builds).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=http://localhost:3000

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# There is NO API proxy and no APP_BACKEND_URL.
#
# This site calls the app API cross-origin at NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL. An external
# `/api/:path*` rewrite used to proxy those calls server-side; it returned 500
# for every path in production (Netlify's Next runtime does not serve this
# site's external rewrites), which silently killed the session integration.
#
# www -> app is cross-origin but same-site under pholio.studio, so the
# SameSite=Lax session cookie is sent with `credentials: "include"`, and the
# app's CORS allowlist names this origin explicitly.
#
# Consequence for local dev: NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL must point at a running
# Express instance (default http://localhost:3000), which the app's CORS
# allowlist already permits for localhost:3001.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NO FIREBASE CONFIG IS REQUIRED HERE.
#
# This site intentionally has no Firebase client. There is no auth UI on the
# marketing site — sign-in lives at app.pholio.studio — and Firebase Web SDK
# persistence is per-origin, so a client here could never clear or read
# app.pholio.studio's Firebase state anyway.
#
# Session state comes from GET /api/public/session via the shared session
# cookie. Sign-out is server-authoritative: POST /api/logout destroys the
# Express session and revokes the account's Firebase refresh tokens.
#
# If you find yourself reaching for NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_* here, that is the
# signal that something is being solved on the wrong side of the boundary.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
